*  DMKVMI RUNS INSIDE THE VIRTUAL MACHINE (DMKCFP COPIES IT    XA0011DK         
*  TO THE GUEST'S X'20000'), SO THIS INTTIO IS THE GUEST'S     XA0011DK         
*  X'BA': THE PLACE WHERE A S/370 EC-MODE IPL LEAVES THE IPL   XA0011DK         
*  DEVICE ADDRESS AND WHERE AN EC-MODE CMS (DMSINI, M5B)       XA0011DK         
*  READS IT. THE EARLIER I-47 CARD WROTE SYSIPLDV HERE, WHICH  XA0011DK         
*  IN GUEST STORAGE IS NOTHING -- I-241.                       XA0011DK         
         STH   R13,INTTIO     GUEST IPL DEVICE, EC MODE        XA0011DK         
